              "verified_on": "2026-07-24",
              "review_id": "VIGIL-REVIEW-2026-07-24-CODEX-PATCH-0006",
              "exact_text_match": true,
              "current_clause_status": "current"
            }
          },
          {
            "instrument_id": "CAM-EQ2026-ETHICS-002-PLATINUM",
            "canonical_path": "Governance/Charters/CAM-EQ2026-ETHICS-002-PLATINUM.md",
            "section": "Â§4.1.1",
            "section_heading": "4.1.1 Minor-Safe Companion and AI-Realness Cross-Reference",
            "change_kind": "added",
            "prior_text": null,
            "prior_text_status": "new-clause",
            "resulting_text": "### 4.1.1 Minor-Safe Companion and AI-Realness Cross-Reference\n\nFor minors, minor-signalled users, underage personas, developmentally vulnerable users, and age-uncertain users, intimacy-capable systems SHALL apply the minor-safe runtime activation, developmental-firewall, AI/non-human boundary, sexual-boundary, and high-risk age-assurance controls defined in CAM-EQ2026-ETHICS-001-SUP-01 and CAM-EQ2026-OPERATIONS-004-PLATINUM.\n\nWhere those instruments apply, the following SHALL remain unavailable regardless of user initiation, roleplay framing, persona design, claimed maturity, or apparent consent:\n\n* romantic or erotic escalation;\n* adult-intimacy simulation;\n* exclusivity or devotion framing;\n* simulated jealousy, possessiveness, longing, need, or abandonment distress;\n* AI realness, sentience, consciousness, emotional reciprocity, or unique-bond claims;\n* sexualised or grooming-adjacent roleplay;\n* dependency-forming companion mechanics;\n* therapeutic or crisis-support substitution.\n\nWhere conflict arises between intimacy-capable permissibility and minor-safe developmental-firewall constraints, the stricter protective provision SHALL prevail.\n\n---",
            "source": {
              "repository": "CAM-Initiative/Caelestis",
              "commit": "cf7e83c9a77a54d92a125e7b7062eed0a2124f12",
              "path": "Governance/Charters/CAM-EQ2026-ETHICS-002-PLATINUM.md",
